      "content": "TL 11 SW                    REDBOURN             CHURCH END (west side) REDBOURN COMMON 5/155                                            E wall to churchyard of Parish Church of St Mary 9.8.74 GV                                               II Churchyard wall in 2 sections either side of entrance gates. C18-C19.  Flint rubble with red brick coping.  About 1.5 metres high.  S side at right adjoins No 68 Church End;  N section is about 20 metres long.  Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL1008411602"
